      "writtenOn": "2025-05-28T19:29:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e Can you confirm that both the guest and the host have the updated arm-ffa driver with that patch ?\n\nI\u0027m testing with Trusty as the guest VM as Arve indicated. The function that calls `FFA_PARTITION_INFO_GET` in a way that takes ownership of the rx buffer is here:\n\nhttps://source.corp.google.com/h/googleplex-android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:trusty/kernel/lib/arm_ffa/arm_ffa.c;l\u003d1614",
